# SynthMK runner-node flow schedule.
#
# One line per check:
#     <flow_file>   <interval_seconds>   [checkmk_host]
#
#   flow_file       file under the mounted flows/ dir (SYNTHMK_FLOWS)
#   interval_s      how often to run this flow (the scheduler is independent
#                   per flow, so slow checks never block fast ones)
#   checkmk_host    OPTIONAL piggyback target — the result is attributed to this
#                   Checkmk host (the monitored site shows up as its own host).
#                   Omit to attach the service to the runner node itself.
#
# Copy to flows.conf and edit. Lines starting with '#' and blank lines ignored.

example-ok.yaml          300
# intranet-wiki.yaml     120     intranet-wiki
# intranet-grafana.yaml  120     intranet-grafana
